title: "Peptacular: A ProForma 2.1 compliant Python package for amino acid sequence analysis"
abstract: >-
  A ProForma 2.1-compliant Python package for parsing, annotating, and
  analyzing peptide and protein sequences, including mass, composition,
  fragmentation, isotope, digestion, and property calculations.
